    <h2>How Segmentation Supports Better Email Marketing</h2>

    <p>
        Effective segmentation can help marketers move from broad
        communication toward more relevant subscriber experiences.
    </p>

    <p>
        When segmentation is based on meaningful information and used
        for a clear purpose, it can support better content targeting,
        automation, and customer communication.
    </p>

    <h2>Conclusion</h2>

    <p>
        Email list segmentation is the process of dividing subscribers
        into useful groups based on characteristics, interests,
        actions, or other relevant information.
    </p>

    <p>
